615 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 112 0 R/T(Banglar Shilpo Ghar is conceived as a journey through Bengal\220s cultural identity, beginning with its folk traditions and evolving into spaces dedicated to art, music and craft. The design translates these cultural influences into a contemporary architectural experience, where movement through the galleries, auditorium, workshop and caf\351 allows visitors to gradually discover and engage with Bengal\220s artistic heritage.)/E(Banglar Shilpo Ghar is conceived as a journey through Bengal\220s cultural identity, beginning with its folk traditions and evolving into spaces dedicated to art, music and craft. The design translates these cultural influences into a contemporary architectural experience, where movement through the galleries, auditorium, workshop and caf\351 allows visitors to gradually discover and engage with Bengal\220s artistic heritage.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

