2683 0 obj
<</Title(HELLO I am Vishakha Bharti a fourth year student doing my Bachelors in  architecture at IIT Kharagpur, and I am still learning what it means to truly listen to a space. Architecture, for me, is not simply about building \204 it is about understanding the quiet negotiations between people and the places they inhabit, between structure and sky, between what a site demands and what a person needs.)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2330 0 R/Next 2824 0 R>>
endobj

2684 0 obj
<</Title(I sketch because thinking slows down when my hand moves. I observe because every built thing has an argument embedded in it. And I design because I believe that space, at its most honest, can hold the full complexity of a human life.)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2330 0 R/Prev 2824 0 R/First 2825 0 R/Last 2825 0 R/Count -1>>
endobj

