3173 0 obj
<</Title(Banglar Shilpo Ghar is conceived as a journey through Bengal\220s cultural identity, beginning with its folk traditions and evolving into spaces dedicated to art, music and craft. The design translates these cultural influences into a contemporary architectural experience, where movement through the galleries, auditorium, workshop and caf\351 allows visitors to gradually discover and engage with Bengal\220s artistic heritage.)/Dest[27 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 3170 0 R/Next 3175 0 R>>
endobj

